    "text": "Who We Are: Samuel Gompers School is a Community School serving over 200 students in grades K-8. It collaborates with the City of Philadelphia, the School District, community-based organizations, and the residents of Philadelphia to pave the way for student success. | What We Do: Our students are supported by a Community School Coordinator and community volunteers for special events, food distribution, and more. Check \"Program Opportunities\" below at a later date to get involved with other volunteer opportunities at Gompers!"
